<title>CHINA: Shanghai Erfangji net falls 63.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Erfangji net falls 63.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	 163.415	vs	   192.515</p>
<p> Net profit	 7.098	vs	    19.473</p>
<p> Net asset per share	2.17 yuan    vs    2.26 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.014 yuan   vs    0.04 yuan</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Shanghai Erfangji Co Ltd . The figures are unaudited.</p>
</text>
